{"time": 1743726591, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#尝试私发"}
{"time": 1743726634, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "对方的id是“果冻”"}
{"time": 1743726662, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个，你为什么要邀请我们”"}
{"time": 1743726800, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "对方的id是“汐”"}
{"time": 1743726909, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "\"嗯...既然你愿意来?为什么还要问我?\""}
{"time": 1743726950, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呃，虽然我愿意来，但还是想知道为什么，以及你是谁”"}
{"time": 1743727269, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "\"那你，因为什么愿意奔赴我的邀请呢？\"三个点，\"我是汐\""}
{"time": 1743727309, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我肯定有我自己的原因”"}
{"time": 1743727399, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "\"如果你不愿意说的话，那就就此作罢吧。无敌剑士123。\""}
{"time": 1743727438, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我想要去这个东西”"}
{"time": 1743727447, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我想要去找个东西”"}
{"time": 1743727575, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧”"}
{"time": 1743727584, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“其实我只是单纯好奇而已”"}
{"time": 1743727614, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我喜欢探险”"}
{"time": 1743727702, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "\"嗯?那我有想让你帮我做的事情。\""}
{"time": 1743727708, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "\"既然你愿意来，想必你也愿意帮我吧？\""}
{"time": 1743727719, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“帮你？什么事情”"}
{"time": 1743727897, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "\"见面的时候再说，可以吗？\"三个点，附上一个笑的emoji，\"也许你没有说你是谁，来自什么地方...但是...我会在门前等你。好不好?\""}
{"time": 1743728061, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“也行吧”"}
{"time": 1743728070, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".st siz"}
{"time": 1743728070, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[水佳佳（古宅）]的[SIZ]: 40"}
{"time": 1743728910, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "\"那，你长什么样子?\""}
{"time": 1743728925, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呃，你定个暗号吧”"}
