{"time": 1743729491, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我们什么时候见面呢”"}
{"time": 1743729769, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "\"我的衣服比较麻烦，看见我应该很显眼。嗯...到时候见，我会在门前等你，见到我留一下就好。对了，我叫瑞依，你叫什么?\""}
{"time": 1743729884, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我叫水佳佳，我大概明晚11点会到那里”"}
{"time": 1743730200, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "\"好的，我会在门前等你，为你打开那扇门扉。\""}
{"time": 1743730783, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我尽量”"}
{"time": 1743730845, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "\"具体的事情见面再说，我会当面倾诉我的要求，希望你也可以。\""}
{"time": 1743772620, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=cb1bacd245f8ef5b4571f3636b5eab47.image,subType=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhS7Zi6JQBKpCYFdb-lDzDc-fnMroxj_qlwg_woozOTunLu-jAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQhYwjRwA1M8v_jOHV0wEEP3oC5pA&amp;spec=0&amp;rkey=CAQSKAB6JWENi5LMRcBkCcvYtMcEtgohLlItwHEPVzlutWw8xsvaUm99z9U]"}
