{"time": 1772454162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "951478702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...一定会有突破的”她看起来又若有所思的样子"}
{"time": 1772454211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1564222900", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "这样的对话在这几天已经有很多次了，每次都以你们互相打气结束"}
{"time": 1772454233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "166728434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "直到今天，已经到了下班时间，她罕见的有些磨蹭"}
{"time": 1772454255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2073063314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我要是不走你不就炸了.jpg）"}
{"time": 1772454389, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1645754993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“凤凰院”少见地，你从她绿色的眼睛里什么都没看见，她喊了你一声"}
{"time": 1772454426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1231042255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么了？”倒是没什么东西要收拾，本来揣上手机就打算走了"}
{"time": 1772454635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1748058167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我解出来了，凤凰院，我找到那场病的根源了……稍等我几分钟、几分钟就好。”她这样说着，激动的攥住你的肩，手劲不知为何比往常都要大。"}
{"time": 1772454648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "971083858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（世界的真理，我已解明（））"}
{"time": 1772454809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1679917980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（huh？）"}
{"time": 1772454854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "264887844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么……你想到什么了吗？”把手机揣进兜里，稍有些不习惯……或者说不适"}
{"time": 1772454883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "909773871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "云母 光熙推着你，把你往门外赶，连同声音都跟着绷紧。"}
{"time": 1772454930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1513425011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不……不能就在这里说吗？云母桑”"}
{"time": 1772454966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "880856446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "随后她用力一推，直接把你推到了门外，然后关上门，你听到了门被反锁的咔哒声"}
{"time": 1772455079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1012677768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“云母？光熙？”有些不知所谓，感觉越来越不对劲了。转身开始敲门"}
{"time": 1772455090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181510019", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（可以过个灵感）"}
{"time": 1772455097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "241718435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。ra灵感"}
