{"time": 1772455103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1032556146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（可以）"}
{"time": 1772455125, "type": "recv", "message_id": "69502404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你想起来，自从先前有研究员出事，研究所的门锁就进行了特殊的改装，哪怕是在门内进行反锁，外面依旧是可以用钥匙打开的，通常而言放置在门框上……这次也不例外"}
{"time": 1772455143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1642477805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（厉害）"}
{"time": 1772455151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "263212192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "拿下钥匙开门"}
{"time": 1772455388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1441159140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在你开门时，你听见门内传来了砰的一声巨响，像是什么东西倒地的声音"}
{"time": 1772455464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "543739424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "开门！"}
{"time": 1772455474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1720225288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你打开门"}
{"time": 1772455504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1523974294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "云母 光熙倒在地上，她抬起眼，正好与你对视。一把带血的解剖刀被他攥在手里，而另一边，她的手腕上划了一道深得像是想把自己左手整个砍下来般的口子。深红色的血液从刀口处涌出，在她的手下汇聚成了一滩血泊。"}
{"time": 1772455522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "690154291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一张画了鬼画符般的草稿纸散在边上，它上面的字迹杂乱无章，看上去就像是哪个小孩随意乱涂出来的一样"}
{"time": 1772455553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1151587674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（按理说现在肯定是没工夫去看那张纸的）"}
{"time": 1772455624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1270977404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“凤凰院....凤凰院...”你看见她在笑，笑得似乎要喘不过气，绷得嗓子里只能发出来气音，像是从喉部的肌肉间硬挤出来的、有什么东西卡在里面一样"}
{"time": 1772455690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2100434434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喂……喂！云母光熙！”情急之下喊的全名，找个衣带赶紧把手臂的近心端绑住“你疯了？！快跟我去医院！”"}
{"time": 1772455767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2033312657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么了...凤凰院....你看我解出来了，为什么不替我高兴呢？”她的脸上露出惨淡的笑容看着你"}
{"time": 1772455784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "940688315", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你感觉到一阵寒冷"}
{"time": 1772455874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "225717124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“解……解什么了？别说胡话了。”试着把她背起来，虽然自己也不知道这种程度的伤口还来不来得及去医院"}
{"time": 1772455947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "625892973", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这...就是...所有的..答案啊...”"}
{"time": 1772455951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "890825790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（sc1/1d3）"}
