{"time": 1772456406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "684373683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "自那之后，云母就一直这样昏迷不醒，你不知道里面的人什么时候醒，也不知道她还会不会醒。"}
{"time": 1772456478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "501898462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那之后我回去过实验室吧）"}
