{"time": 1772456647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062448094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那我现在要干什么（）"}
{"time": 1772456709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2005175885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "这时候你忽然听到了什么声音从走廊另一头传来"}
{"time": 1772456764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "852779282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "看看另一头"}
{"time": 1772456831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "878132996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“七号病人换输液袋。”\n特殊隔离病房的护士从走廊另一端推着推车慢悠悠地过来，她穿着全套的隔离服，路过你时或许是觉得眼熟，说了这么一句。"}
{"time": 1772456849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "387969682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "自然指的是云母"}
{"time": 1772456987, "type": "recv", "message_id": "22744752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有什么变化吗？”来都来了，顺口一问"}
{"time": 1772457044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "401168439", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“前天的时候病人出现了一些类似于噩梦的生理反应，嗯……像四肢小幅度抽搐，眉头紧锁这样。由于病人无法唤醒，我们暂时无法干预她的噩梦。在那之后，她的呼吸似乎比之前更加微弱了。"}
{"time": 1772457384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "93998161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……谢谢”"}
{"time": 1772457399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1664220088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”她点了点头"}
{"time": 1772457411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "994875154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在进入病房前，她照例进行了全身消毒，而后拿药、进门、再进行换药工作。\n换药工作其实很快，跟普通感冒的换液至少看上去是一样的。"}
{"time": 1772457421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1676163672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“也就是说……已经一年多了啊”有点想抽烟，但是医院……还是放了回去"}
{"time": 1772457446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1956371790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1040792363", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "这时候，你手机滴滴响了两声"}
